1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:01,930
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Joanne had a blue backpack.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:04,290
She had it for a month.

3
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:06,490
It was not that nice.

4
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:08,950
It was popular last year.

5
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:12,330
This year, backpacks were out.

6
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,690
All the popular girls had handbags.

7
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,430
The rich girls had designer bags.

8
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:21,410
Only guys had backpacks now.

9
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,430
Joanne still had a backpack though.

10
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,150
A mean girl made fun of her.

11
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,430
Joanne turned red.

12
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:31,890
She felt so bad.

13
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,650
She threw away her backpack at home.

14
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,230
Her mom saw it in the trash can.

15
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:40,350
She asked Joanne what was wrong.

16
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,250
Joanne explained what had happened.

17
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,730
You shouldn't throw it away.

18
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:48,430
Be unique, her mom said.

19
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,870
Joanne thought her mom was right.

20
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:53,270
She got back the backpack.
